# patches/glinet/series - extra patches for the GL.iNet "mt5000" branch
#
# The GL.iNet branch (https://github.com/GLiNet-Tech/openwrt, branch mt5000)
# already contains the DTS, the image definition, the board scripts and the
# RTL8366UB DSA kernel patches, so normally nothing has to be patched here.
#
# The file is kept empty on purpose - it documents that the GL.iNet pipeline
# needs no additional patching, and it gives a place for local fixes.
#
